---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---
<Layout title="About | Mohamed Meghawry">
  <h1 class="text-3xl font-bold tracking-tight">About</h1>
  <div class="mt-8 space-y-6 text-gray-700 leading-relaxed">
    <p>Based in Toronto. Bachelor of Computer Science from York University. Bilingual in English and Arabic.</p>
    <p>Background in IT support and operations across higher education, hospitality, and nonprofit settings. Current focus is the SOC Tier 1 Analyst pathway.</p>
  </div>
  <section class="mt-12">
    <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold tracking-tight">Core skills</h2>
    <ul class="mt-4 space-y-2 text-gray-700 list-disc list-inside">
      <li>Active Directory and identity management</li>
      <li>Microsoft 365 and Azure AD administration</li>
      <li>Endpoint troubleshooting, Windows and macOS</li>
      <li>Automation engineering with JavaScript and Make.com</li>
      <li>Bilingual system design (EN/AR)</li>
    </ul>
  </section>
</Layout>
